  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n78 % of A = 32.5 % of B\n\n⇒ 78 × A = 32.5 × B\n\n⇒ B/A = (78/32.5)\n\n⇒ B/A = (2 × 78)/65\n\n⇒ B/A = (2 ×6)/5 \n\n⇒ B/A = 12/5 \n\n**∴ The ratio of B to A = 12 : 5**",
